While Kiran and Sara sit in the hall, I set the dining table.
First, I wipe and clean the table.
After that, I place three plates on the table.
Then, I bring three glasses and a jug of water.
I place that jug in the middle of the table.
I also place three spoons near the plates.
Now there is a good smell coming from the kitchen.
I bring and place hot rice in a large bowl on the table.
After that, I place the chicken curry on the table too.
"Everything is ready, let's eat," I say happily.
